# Build output (the pack itself + its zip). The publisher rebuilds from
# verdicts.json + the curated candidates, so the artifact stays out of git —
# same convention as dja/journey_pack/dist/. verdicts.json (the owner's picks)
# IS tracked; the derived pack is not.
dist/
*.zip
